│ User visits AFTER timer expires            │
│ → Still sees OLD page                      │
│ → Next.js starts BACKGROUND regeneration   │
└────────────────────────────┬───────────────┘
                             │
                             ▼
┌────────────────────────────┐
│ Fetch NEW data (e.g., 8 items)
│ Update static HTML page     │
